 "_doc": "Growatt live weather sensors, energy meters and string operating points against the stub Growatt (growatt_stub.py; seed.d/71_live_sensors.sql). Ignored: each backend's own fetch times, refresh_in_s and record ages (they depend on when the request lands), and interval_s. The engineer's plants are set to [7101] and restored at the end.",
